      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are two distinct response templates for a shipping delay inquiry.\n\n**Standard Professional:** \"Thank you for reaching out regarding your order. We sincerely apologize for the shipping delay and the inconvenience this may cause. We are actively monitoring the situation and anticipate your package will be delivered by [New Date]. Please let us know if you have any other questions.\"\n\n**Casual/Urban:** \"Hey! Sorry about the shipping hiccup on your order—we know waiting is a drag. Things are running a little behind schedule, but we've got it locked in to get it to you by [New Date]. Lmk if you need anything else while you wait!\"",
