      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To make it feel more authentic, we need to drop the performative coolness and go for genuine, high-energy conversational language. How about this: \"Yo, my bad about the shipping hold-up on your order. Things got caught up in the hustle, but we're on it—it's gonna hit your doorstep by [New Date]. Stay tuned, we got you!\" This version uses more colloquial phrasing to sound immediate and relatable.",
